---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="site">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p><b>PPA Lab</b> · 연세대학교 전기전자공학부 학부생 스터디·프로젝트 팀</p>
    <p class="mono">
      <a href="https://github.com/Yonsei-PPA-Lab">github.com/Yonsei-PPA-Lab</a>
      <span>© {year}</span>
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  footer.site { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); margin-top: var(--s-8); }
  .wrap { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px 40px; justify-content: space-between; padding-block: var(--s-6) var(--s-7); font-size: var(--fs-small); color: var(--ink-2); }
  p { margin: 0; }
  b { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }
  .mono { font-size: 13px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px 20px; }
</style>
